---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Before live customer data comes in." description="Production data-processing terms are still being prepared.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Production documentation pending" title="Before live customer data comes in." lede="Production data-processing terms are still being prepared." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>No processing agreement is established by this page</h2>
<p>The preview does not connect a merchant account or import customer conversations. This page does not claim that a live data-processing arrangement is already in place.</p>
<h2>What needs to be documented</h2>
<p>The live service needs agreed instructions, data categories, access controls, subprocessors, storage locations, retention, deletion and incident procedures. These depend on the actual services selected and the merchant agreement.</p>
<h2>Start with sample data</h2>
<p>Use fictional products, customers and payments to review the demo. Confirm the production documentation before onboarding business or customer records.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
